# LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this a Windows checkout gets CRLF from core.autocrlf, and
# build-standalone.mjs matches head patterns containing literal \n, so
# `npm run standalone` fails with "Pattern not found". Pages builds on
# Linux, so LF is the only ending the site is ever served with.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
